flowchart TD
    A[User enters pet care request] --> B[Streamlit Interface]

    B --> C[AI Task Parser]
    C --> D{Is required information missing?}

    D -- Yes --> E[Ask user for clarification]
    E --> B

    D -- No --> F[Planning Agent]

    F --> G[Create structured Task objects]
    G --> H[PawPal Scheduler]

    H --> I[Sort tasks by date, time, and priority]
    H --> J[Detect schedule conflicts]
    H --> K[Generate recurring tasks]

    J --> L[Knowledge Retriever]
    L --> M[Retrieve relevant pet care guidance]

    I --> N[Guardrails and Validation]
    J --> N
    K --> N
    M --> N

    N --> O[Generate schedule and explanation]
    O --> P[Display result to user]

    O --> Q[Evaluation Logger]
    Q --> R[Automated tests and human review]